 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "New day, new file.",
   "t0": 0.391,
   "t1": 1.552
  },
  {
   "text": "Hit save, smile.",
   "t0": 4.233,
   "t1": 5.474
  },
  {
   "text": "Woke up light, no weight on my back.",
   "t0": 8.975,
   "t1": 10.756
  },
  {
   "text": "Coffee's hot, the sky's not black.",
   "t0": 10.976,
   "t1": 12.897
  },
  {
   "text": "Yesterday, I left it on the train.",
   "t0": 12.937,
   "t1": 14.838
  },
  {
   "text": "Didn't even look, didn't take the name.",
   "t0": 14.898,
   "t1": 16.899
  },
  {
   "text": "Window open at the morning in.",
   "t0": 16.919,
   "t1": 18.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Every little noise sounds like a grin.",
   "t0": 18.9,
   "t1": 20.701
  },
  {
   "text": "One step, two steps, slow is fine.",
   "t0": 20.921,
   "t1": 24.363
  },
  {
   "text": "One thing, one thing, one at a time.",
   "t0": 24.463,
   "t1": 28.005
  },
  {
   "text": "Clean slate, clean slate Nothing to carry, nothing to weigh Here now, here now Feet on the ground and I don't know how But I'm floating, I'm floating Brand new morning, brand new morning Clean slate Clean slate",
   "t0": 28.904,
   "t1": 44.69
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh, boxes into the bin.",
   "t0": 52.072,
   "t1": 53.635
  },
  {
   "text": "The trash is just off the spin.",
   "t0": 53.976,
   "t1": 55.579
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the good, let the rich go home.",
   "t0": 55.679,
   "t1": 57.583
  },
  {
   "text": "Build a little palace room by room.",
   "t0": 57.643,
   "t1": 60.028
  },
  {
   "text": "Numbers and colors in my head.",
   "t0": 60.369,
   "t1": 63.194
  },
  {
   "text": "Ideas growing where the worries fade One step, two steps, slow kiss finding One thing, one thing, one at a time Clean slate, clean slate Nothing to carry, nothing to weigh Here now, here now Me on the ground and I don't know how But I'm floating, I'm floating Brand new morning, uh Brand new morning, uh Clean slate",
   "t0": 64.373,
   "t1": 91.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Breathe in.",
   "t0": 94.74,
   "t1": 95.401
  },
  {
   "text": "Breathe out.",
   "t0": 98.605,
   "t1": 99.486
  },
  {
   "text": "Past is a postcard, future is a door Today's the only thing I'm asking for Clean slate, clean slate Nothing to carry, nothing to weigh Here now, here now Feet on the ground and I don't know But I'm floating, I'm floating Brand new morning, brand new morning Clean slate Clean slate",
   "t0": 103.174,
   "t1": 130.153
  },
  {
   "text": "Smile.",
   "t0": 134.652,
   "t1": 135.134
  },
  {
